                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e6affd3-eb76-3f3c-910b-f651b97c7766",
                        "entry_id": "0fb393fb-0dbf-3986-b8ba-4cf6165efd88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Intelligence supérieure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42169386-0892-49d4-a2c4-362ec0989ee2",
                                "sense_id": "5e6affd3-eb76-3f3c-910b-f651b97c7766",
                                "text": "La superintelligence a le potentiel de bousculer l'ordre naturel établi entre les espèces"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4cae5a60-25d5-30a0-b3c8-755206f88b53",
                        "entry_id": "0fb393fb-0dbf-3986-b8ba-4cf6165efd88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Intelligence supérieure à celle de tout être humain."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a050ce23-ebfa-44d5-a54d-6806da82b1a3",
                                "sense_id": "4cae5a60-25d5-30a0-b3c8-755206f88b53",
                                "text": "Mais comment s’assurer qu’une superintelligence ne se révèlera pas hostile à la survie de l’humanité ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d620b9ba-08de-4d8c-a834-5b874c5ea461",
                                "sense_id": "4cae5a60-25d5-30a0-b3c8-755206f88b53",
                                "text": "« La superintelligence, c'est une façon de récupérer des super milliards »."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29c4e8c1-76c4-368a-b334-55438cc55533",
                        "entry_id": "0fb393fb-0dbf-3986-b8ba-4cf6165efd88",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Intelligence supérieure à celle de tout être vivant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40da90fc-a236-46b6-9318-2c3ac9203516",
                                "sense_id": "29c4e8c1-76c4-368a-b334-55438cc55533",
                                "text": "Mais le problème est de prévoir comment « cacher » à cette « superintelligence » le système qui va l'inactiver"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "358edc1c-79d8-460e-85bd-37f1f052dc3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0fb393fb-0dbf-3986-b8ba-4cf6165efd88",
                        "target_lang_word": "Superintelligenz",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "491ee193-25f5-4ebc-ad7e-5a743c0ee706",
                        "source_entry_id": "0fb393fb-0dbf-3986-b8ba-4cf6165efd88",
                        "target_lang_word": "superintelligence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superintelligence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65e43949-da4a-366a-9ca9-9d0081cd1060",
                                        "entry_id": "e5075397-0fce-3c6e-ae4a-7d761a5a509f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intelligence surpassing the level of a human genius."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed26e6d5-01af-4e26-a0da-dba1fd24d763",
                                                "sense_id": "65e43949-da4a-366a-9ca9-9d0081cd1060",
                                                "text": "The lesson of this little story is that if and when human-level AI is achieved, superintelligence will soon follow. […] What we have in this story seems to be a form of collective superintelligence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "870596ec-3661-4681-9a61-594f1fe610c5",
                                                "sense_id": "65e43949-da4a-366a-9ca9-9d0081cd1060",
                                                "text": "On Thursday, Meta unveiled a $14.3 billion investment and partnership that will be the core of a new artificial intelligence research lab dedicated to the pursuit of “superintelligence,” a swing-for-the-fences effort in the global technology race. […] Silicon Valley leaders are now talking about building superintelligence, which would be even more powerful than A.G.I. It, too, is a loosely defined term, but generally refers to a machine that is more powerful than the human brain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c51eda4c-cada-4dce-8614-cc70cb0a2616",
                                                "sense_id": "65e43949-da4a-366a-9ca9-9d0081cd1060",
                                                "text": "Fundamentally, people like Mr. Altman, the Anthropic chief executive Dario Amodei and countless other tech leaders and investors had put far too much faith into a speculative and unproven hypothesis called scaling: the idea that training A.I. models on ever more data and using ever more hardware would eventually lead to A.G.I. or even a superintelligence that surpasses humans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
